WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Sign in to Opstack console as an owner and open the relevant shared settings.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: In Account setup emails, configure the verified sender, Resend key, enablement and welcome template, then save.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Use New network defaults for future starting colours, font, welcome and greeting; retain {user} once in the greeting.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Use Platform appearance for shared sign-in branding. Review which scope is affected before saving.
